% Publications of Luca Frigau
%
% Single source for the Publications page and for the publication lists on
% the Home and Research pages. Entries are grouped by type and shown in
% reverse chronological order; the order of entries within the same year is
% the order used in this file.
%
% Conventions (see README.md, "Add a publication"):
%   - entry types: article (journal article), incollection (book
%     chapter), inproceedings (conference proceedings or abstracts);
%   - titles are shown exactly as written here (no automatic case change);
%   - keywords: "selected" marks a selected publication; the id of a
%     research area (data/research.yml) assigns the entry to that area in
%     the publication charts, e.g. keywords = {selected, clustering}. Every
%     entry has exactly one area: clustering, trees, text-mining, heaping,
%     image-analysis, or other-topics for works outside these lines;
%   - annote = {...} is a one-sentence summary shown under the entry;
%   - code = {URL} and data = {URL} add links to code and data;
%   - openalex = {W...} confirms by hand the OpenAlex record of an entry
%     without DOI, for the citation map (scripts/citation_map.py);
%   - langid = {italian} for Italian-language titles.
%   Write one field per line: the "Cite" box omits keywords, annote, code,
%   data and openalex, which only matter to this site.
%
% Source: CV of Luca Frigau (26 October 2026), cross-checked against the
% publishers' metadata (Crossref) on 27 October 2026.


